+/// The diagnostic-log members of [AgentCli]: the fa.log writer
+/// (`_logDiagnostic`/`_appendDiagnosticLog`), the short session id for log
+/// lines (`_logSid`) and the log path resolver (`_diagnosticLogPath`).
